%% Robotic arm modular architecture with coordination
flowchart LR
    classDef module fill:#e8f2fb,stroke:#0a5387,stroke-width:2px,rx:18px,ry:18px,color:#0a5387
    classDef coord fill:#ffffff,stroke:#0a5387,stroke-dasharray:6 4,rx:16px,ry:16px,color:#0a5387

    System[[Robotic Arm System]]:::coord --> Joint1(Joint Module 1):::module
    System --> Joint2(Joint Module 2):::module
    System --> Joint3(Joint Module 3):::module
    Joint1 -->|Surrogate constraints| Coordinator{{Shared Constraint Hub}}:::coord
    Joint2 -->|Surrogate constraints| Coordinator
    Joint3 -->|Surrogate constraints| Coordinator
    Coordinator --> Control(Control Software):::module

    Control --> Telemetry[Telemetry & Feedback Loop]:::coord
    Telemetry --> Coordinator
